"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1JCZCRW2S1S06KN0\",\"title\":\"Darjeeling Revival Project — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"VALIDATION UNSUCCESSFUL\",\"EW\",\"Darjeeling Revival Project\",\"Alt Carbon\",\"->\",\"PROJECT DETAILS\",\"Validated by\",\"E\",\"Earthood\",\"->\",\"Project code\",\"2A0D\"],\"issued_header\":null,\"buffer_header\":null,\"crediting\":null,\"verifier\":null,\"code\":\"2A0D\",\"approval\":null,\"protocol_current\":\"Enhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.0\",\"protocol_baseline\":null,\"cert_issued\":null,\"cert_retired\":null,\"cert_buffer\":null,\"reversal\":null,\"showing\":[\"Showing 3 of 3\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"07 Nov 2025\",\"Unsuccessful Validation and Verification Report\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"06 Apr 2025\",\"Public Comment Period Summary\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"07 Mar 2025\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"https://alt-carbon.com\",\"t\":\"Alt Carbon\"},{\"h\":\"https://earthood.in\",\"t\":\"E | Earthood\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/enhanced-weathering-agriculture/1.0\",\"t\":\"Enhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.0\"},{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1J6EQFMYF1S00KDE\",\"t\":\"Learn more\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1J6EQFMYF1S00KDE/prj_1JCZCRW2S1S06KN0/pjd_1KAE1CDYJ1S0RAY1/unsuccessful_validation_and_verification_report.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1J6EQFMYF1S00KDE/prj_1JCZCRW2S1S06KN0/pjd_1JXMG5APJ1S0P2PP/public_comment_period_summary.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1J6EQFMYF1S00KDE/prj_1JCZCRW2S1S06KN0/pjd_1JSMPJEKN1S0F9WV/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"VALIDATION UNSUCCESSFUL\\nEW\\nDarjeeling Revival Project\\nAlt Carbon\\n->\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nValidated by\\nE\\nEarthood\\n->\\nProject code\\n2A0D\\nPROTOCOL DETAILS\\nCurrent protocol version\\nEnhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.0\\nSummary\\n\\nThe project is primarily focused on the Terai region, leveraging the high rainfall, warm summers, and collaboration with local tea growers. The project enhances soil health and crop productivity while sequestering atmospheric CO₂. This approach aids in carbon removal and supports the local economy, preserves biodiversity, and promotes sustainable agricultural practices.\\n\\nDarjeeling, India\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nEnhanced Weathering (EW) accelerates the Earth's natural chemical weathering process to remove carbon dioxide from the atmosphere. In chemical weathering, carbon dioxide dissolved in rainwater reacts with minerals in rocks, partly dissolving them and producing stable bicarbonate ions. These bicarbonate ions are transported by rivers to the ocean, where they are safely stored for thousands of years. EW is typically carried out by spreading crushed reactive rocks or minerals on croplands.\\n\\nLearn more\\nProject timeline\\nCompleted 2024\\nInitial documentation submission\\nCompleted 2024\\nAudit kick-off\\nCompleted 2024\\nSite visit\\nCompleted 05 Apr 2025\\nPublic comment period\\n2025\\nValidation unsuccessful\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n07 Nov 2025\\tUnsuccessful Validation and Verification Report\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n06 Apr 2025\\tPublic Comment Period Summary\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n07 Mar 2025\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 3 of 3\\nPrevious\\nNext\"}"